		"This course offers a broad overview of European cinema and is split into three segments of similar scope. The first addresses Western European cinema during the period 1960-1990, the second will focus on the Eastern European counterpart during the same time period, and the third and final segment will consider the impact of the European Union and the fall of the Soviet Union upon filmmaking in the continent overall."
